"home textile" is a shop category of textile articles,
    as stated in the other products listing format, confer "\"Home & Garden > Home Textile\"".

% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% The rules: a word in the name or in a field
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
rule textile_kind_by_name with provenance the other products listing format,
        confer "A listing offers one finished product for sale":
the kind of a good is a kind
    if the good is called a name
    and the name is a word for the textile kind the kind.

rule textile_kind_by_field with provenance the other products listing format,
        confer "Item Type (99 listings): the kind of product in the seller's words":
the kind of a good is a kind
    if the field a field of the good reads a value
    and the field is a field of the kind of a textile article
    and the value is a word for the textile kind the kind.

rule technics_field with provenance the other products listing format,
        confer "Technics (19 listings): how a textile product is made":
the fabric construction of a good is a construction
    if the field "technics" of the good reads a value
    and the value is a technics value for the construction.

% canvas is a woven fabric (a plain weave)
rule canvas_woven with provenance the encyclopedia article canvas,
        confer "Canvas is a durable plain-woven fabric":
the fabric construction of a good is woven
    if the good names the material "canvas"
    and it is not the case that
        the field "technics" of the good reads a value.

rule textile_by_material_word with provenance the other products listing format,
        confer "Material (153 listings): for example":
a good is of textile material
    if the good names the material a name
    and the name is a word for a textile fabric.

% the shop's category says that the product is a home textile
rule textile_by_category with provenance the other products listing format,
        confer "Home & Garden > Home Textile":
a good is of textile material
    if the good is in the shop category a category
    and the category is a shop category of textile articles.

rule terry_by_material_word with provenance the encyclopedia article terrycloth,
        confer "or simply terry is a fabric woven with many protruding loops of thread":
the fabric of a good is terry
    if the good names the material a name
    and the name is a word for a terry fabric.

% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% Tests
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

query kinds is:
    the kind of which good is which kind.

query constructions is:
    the fabric construction of which good is which construction.

query textiles is:
    which good is of textile material.

query terry is:
    the fabric of which good is terry.

scenario home_textiles is:
    the field "item type" of item 1 reads "blankets".
    the field "technics" of item 1 reads "knitted".
    item 2 is called "throw blanket".
    the field "type" of item 3 reads "cushion covers".
    the field "technics" of item 3 reads "woven".
    item 3 is in the shop category "home & garden".
    item 3 is in the shop category "home textile".
    item 4 is called "curtain panel".
    item 4 names the material "cloth".
    item 5 is called "kitchen towel".
    item 5 names the material "terry".
    the field "item type" of item 6 reads "shoelaces".
    item 7 is called "storage bags".
    item 7 names the material "canvas".
    the field "category" of item 8 reads "garden flag".
    item 9 is called "auto detailing cloths".
    item 10 is called "tarp".
    kinds expects answers ["the kind of item 1 is blanket", "the kind of item 2 is blanket", "the kind of item 3 is cushion cover", "the kind of item 4 is curtain panel", "the kind of item 5 is kitchen towel", "the kind of item 6 is shoelace", "the kind of item 7 is storage bag", "the kind of item 8 is garden flag", "the kind of item 9 is cleaning cloth", "the kind of item 10 is tarpaulin"].
    constructions expects answers ["the fabric construction of item 1 is knitted", "the fabric construction of item 3 is woven", "the fabric construction of item 7 is woven"].
    textiles expects answers ["item 3 is of textile material", "item 4 is of textile material", "item 7 is of textile material"].
    terry expects answers ["the fabric of item 5 is terry"].
